            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Проверь, не равен ли <code>playerGuess</code><code>secretCode</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerGuess = \" /><text value=\"&quot;redKey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" secretCode = \" /><text value=\"&quot;blueKey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerGuess !== secretCode);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145360,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Сохрани строку в <code>equippedSprite</code>, чтобы отобразить <code>false</code> в консоли.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;enemy.png&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equippedSprite = \" /><text value=\"&quot;hero.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(equippedSprite !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;hero.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>\"hero.png\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
