            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Проверь, что <code>bossName</code> не равно <code>minionName</code>, используя код <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Titan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minionName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bossName !== minionName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
